{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "76b4cbaad57644251f53de76ac268c15506cc687ead9de9d1869af31d1d4d9a6", "ja": "（これからPV撮影のリハーサル。着替え終わった\nのり子は、コンセプトのチェックをしている……）", "zh": "（接下来是PV拍摄的彩排。换好衣服的\n德莉子正在确认概念……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "640ccfd5d4f27c8d2b6f8f70924cc914d05b1c01b4db97abe4c3634410da98f8", "ja": "ふむふむ……アタシの演じるウェイトレスが\n夢の中で、小さくなっちゃうんだね。", "zh": "嗯嗯……也就是说，我要饰演的女服务生会在梦里变小。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "9905564a8b4340ccced7739b881514c04b90f165d04154d0760d1439501da8ad", "ja": "雑貨で遊んだり、お客さんにオススメしたり……。\nオッケー、イメージ湧いてきたっ！", "zh": "玩玩杂货，给客人推荐商品……好，已经有画面了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7b6a9046e4aa86598cc2b3654075ff90bb6d76ef6cd27393cf695bb7c60dc77e", "ja": "ああ、よろしくな！\nどの雑貨を選ぶかは、のり子に任せるって。", "zh": "啊，那就拜托你了！\n我说，选哪件杂货就交给法子你来决定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "8860404eeea66a1a39cd18009f10a3e1269c9a9fd0614b6defdaaab0f160150e", "ja": "えっ、アタシの好きなのでいいの？\nうわっ、難しいな～！　どれもカワイイんだもん。", "zh": "诶，选我喜欢的就可以吗？\n哇，好难选啊～！因为每个都好可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "f644e7036d176dc22a91668117f4299eeaf453e7ebc936bd70ccb28ec578811d", "ja": "どっしりしてて、ピカピカで、パワフルで！\n全部、アタシの好きな感じなんだよね。", "zh": "沉稳、闪亮、充满力量！\n全都是我喜欢的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3f8a0eab11cb270875752f09f4f9ddfa0c8ee89dd90bc939c415b536aaf3d862", "ja": "ひとつには絞れないか？　のり子の好きなので\nいいんだけど……ああ、だったら。", "zh": "不能只选一个吗？选个诺莉子喜欢的就行……啊，那样的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d3a7732eff3399e5fa9dea93cd20514d3f075067bb03c4f30969674dc7846733", "ja": "のり子が選んだものを、買ってプレゼントするよ。\nそれなら、自分が一番好きなものを選べないか？", "zh": "把你选的买下来送给你。\n这样的话，就不能选自己最喜欢的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "377654a32080943a312cfb592d4885065402026e07978b7e989e7171c49c048d", "ja": "えっ！？　ホントに？　買ってくれるの？\n{$P$}が、アタシに……？", "zh": "咦！？真的？你要买给我吗？\n{$P$}要送给我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "a2780db06c8b95dfe8d0943075ca8ff3f42e0629e3070ff8d8837af4b9b5639f", "ja": "って、それはそれで迷っちゃうよ！　うーっ……。\n……でも、決めたっ！　このバイクのおもちゃにする！", "zh": "话说回来，那样反而会让我纠结啊！呜——……\n……不过，我决定了！就选这个摩托车玩具！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "55a0b179aeccc49c5c20e865e2659ced5a80fe85a311f38ccb499b8743dff93f", "ja": "結構いかついのを選んだな……。\nバイクっていうのは、のり子らしいけど。", "zh": "你选的还挺霸气的嘛……不过选摩托车倒是很符合你的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "8e000e709ae2e32ae0c7b2567702ddb92e01d7ad3b2e752d8e42d61bbc84fb54", "ja": "へへっ♪　だってカッコイイじゃん。\nアタシ、おっきなバイクも好きなんだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪因为很帅嘛。\n我也喜欢大型摩托车！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "47ff614716bf7b1c4a91eef5c6c49b09aff0af1a80524b8a7f1410ae81fc25ce", "ja": "いつかはこういうゴツイので、\n広い道を走ってみたいなって思うんだよね。", "zh": "总觉得有朝一日，好想骑着这种威风沉稳的机车，\n在宽敞的道路上兜风啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "09841a93c9bfa61e7248d11a8679a7e01af6ca08377ce0420f2c5003d1dea868", "ja": "なるほど、それがのり子の夢なんだな。\nじゃあそのバイク、後で買っておくから。", "zh": "原来如此，这就是典子的梦想啊。\n那辆摩托车我之后买给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "787e96a1fdc528558cd54dba3bb07b729ec1594d523fc066873334362a575de7", "ja": "ホントにいいの？\nえへへ……ありがとね、大事にする！", "zh": "真的可以吗？\n嘿嘿……谢谢你，我会好好珍惜的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d56cbe3221650b60f0ff6989bece8780c6e51e51398b1b57c256878bcd0cffc2", "ja": "うん。いつかはおもちゃじゃなくて、\n本物の大型バイクにも乗れるといいな。", "zh": "嗯。希望总有一天，我也能骑上真正的大型摩托车，而不是玩具。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "4cb341d70f3a5fdbb0d4e1d8fd6782450ab8d5972a67e24afb34ab44f8bb5912", "ja": "そうだね！　でも……。\n今はアタシ、このバイク君で満足だよ？", "zh": "是啊！不过……现在有这辆摩托车，我就满足了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "468f1747d857369096bed3dac303150711da927a2f71f0a6e3fb512945491397", "ja": "このバイク君に、アタシの夢を乗せて……。\nアイドル街道をひとっ走り！　なんてね♪", "zh": "把我的梦想载上这辆摩托车……在偶像之路上飞驰一圈！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9b6b843d50a0d27d760a0850a3c6f5141e681767b7bceecea219f6c77f91b215", "ja": "はは、アイドル街道か……。\nそういう事なら、俺も一緒に乗りたいな。", "zh": "哈哈，偶像之路啊……\n既然这样，我也想一起骑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "01d6ed59ee97904f698f4a50e8e252108db898e519570a109701ee188c2881f3", "ja": "ほら、プロデューサーなわけだし。\nアイドルと二人旅って事で、どうだろう？", "zh": "毕竟我是制作人嘛。要不要来一场和偶像两个人的旅行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "603029a869680c85042c4185ba0cc23adee4788e5a595f5a2362c995183e8db8", "ja": "あははっ、もちろん！\nそしたら{$P$}は、タンデムで……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，当然好啊！\n那{$P$}就双人骑行，坐后座……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "f7a6113f0385ba45a641a5dbfc4f8d3fa983a6262e564e9cc55e0f61d894d973", "ja": "あっ、やっぱり待ってっ！\nそれだと疲れちゃうか……長旅になるしね。", "zh": "啊，还是等一下！\n那样的话会累着吧……毕竟是长途旅行嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "3ac2ecaa57d8c5f24168a566a130f78ae775f1705ec2f7bdadcb9877a3dbf7c3", "ja": "すみませーんっ、このバイクのおもちゃ、\nサイドカーってあったりしませんか～！？", "zh": "不好意思——请问，这个摩托车玩具有没有带边车的呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0244_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1ca361abc15680e042e29bc4d2b18611f45c6e643c7bb16649dc05b3f1b62ca8", "ja": "（夢へと向かうのり子の道を、支えていきたいな。\nタンデムでも、サイドからでも！）", "zh": "（我想支持典子朝着梦想前进的道路。无论是和她并肩，还是从旁边支持她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
